Package: L1000PAIdata
Title: Signature Libraries for L1000PAI
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Yilin", "Chiu", , "yilin1107@mail.ndmutsgh.edu.tw", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Downloads, converts and verifies the L1000 perturbation signature
    libraries used by the 'L1000PAI' package. The libraries are fetched from
    their public source (Enrichr gene-set libraries built from LINCS L1000
    data), converted deterministically to the 'L1000PAI' file format, and
    accepted only when their content fingerprint matches the reference
    release used for the L1000PAI analyses. Verified files are kept in a
    per-user cache. The package distributes no signature data.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
